    "description": "Deloitte India Digital Technologies invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Risk Analyst at our Chandigarh location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Deloitte India Digital Technologies:\nDeloitte India Digital Technologies is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n• Prepare annual reports and investor presentations\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n• Manage credit risk assessment and loan appraisal processes\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Arch / M.Arch from recognized institution\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in Tally\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in IFRS\n• Proficiency in Credit Analysis\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Flexible working hours\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Deloitte India Digital Technologies!",
